OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order submits new 'limited'
OL,4,ADrumcree parade plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Orange Order has announced plans
OL,7,Ffor a new parade at Drumcree, one of
OL,8,Fthe most contentious parade routes in
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,11,FThey said they had scaled back the
OL,12,Fplans and hoped the parade would be
OL,13,Fallowed along the mainly nationalist
OL,14,FGarvaghy Road. They said only 60
OL,15,Fmembers would march along the road in
OL,16,FPortadown in silence on Sunday 27
OL,17,FSeptember.
OL,19,FThe submission comes after a court case
OL,20,Fin which a ruling on Drumcree by the
OL,21,FParades Commission was overturned.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
